  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0827:b001:l006": "Керүү read as open rolling slopes; descriptive terrain, not a caravan.",
    "manas-2010:p0827:b001:l017": "Беленди/Белендин retained as the named ridge; spelling varies in the same passage.",
    "manas-2010:p0827:b001:l026": "Айырмач is a saddle form; the topographic simile is retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0827:b001:l028": "Conditional about popular well-being is printed here despite its loose connection to the empty landscape.",
    "manas-2010:p0827:b001:l035": "Unhealing trouble is a literal, provisional reading of айыкпаган бир кыйын; the following dust points to impending combat.",
    "manas-2010:p0828:b001:l007": "God is the implicit subject of the favor-and-road proverb in lines7–8.",
    "manas-2010:p0828:b001:l018": "The grammatical subject shifts in this recollection; inability is retained without inventing a new named actor.",
    "manas-2010:p0828:b001:l026": "Meat joint and orphaned yearling in26–27 are things not paid; their precise marriage-gift function is inferred from context.",
    "manas-2010:p0828:b001:l032": "Forced acquisition as a booty-wife is explicit; it is not rendered as consent.",
    "manas-2010:p0828:b001:l034": "Ике read as нике, the marriage rite; repeated explicitly at833:27–28.",
    "manas-2010:p0829:b001:l002": "The printed claim that the khan died is retained although Bakay is recounting his own earlier suffering; possible hyperbole or inconsistency.",
    "manas-2010:p0829:b001:l019": "Кыргыл баштык: Kyrgyl at the head; not a bag.",
    "manas-2010:p0829:b001:l028": "The number sixty is retained alongside forty companions; no harmonization.",
    "manas-2010:p0829:b001:l029": "Эгиз is paired/twin in praise here; no biological kinship asserted for Ajybay and Bakay.",
    "manas-2010:p0830:b001:l013": "Бил is elephant in this drum formula.",
    "manas-2010:p0830:b001:l042": "Image confirms кап, covering/sac, not кан blood; unusual heart-covering formula retained without emendation.",
    "manas-2010:p0831:b001:l005": "Окоро түйгөн denotes a shortened loop/knot in the submission rope, not a halter made of a named material.",
    "manas-2010:p0831:b001:l007": "Теке жоомарт: primary 2015 dictionary gives fine swift horse/аргымак and Teke/Yomud tribal derivation. Rendered swift thoroughbred, not literal generous goat. https://el-sozduk.kg/теке%20жоомарт/",
    "manas-2010:p0831:b001:l026": "Two reins and one lead rope are the explicit image of yielding control.",
    "manas-2010:p0831:b001:l035": "Кундуз represented as otter pelts and жамбы as silver ingots; no modern monetary equivalence.",
    "manas-2010:p0832:b001:l003": "The odd statement about remaining where they did not die is preserved rather than expanded into an invented escape episode.",
    "manas-2010:p0832:b001:l023": "Numerous surviving troops are printed after the earlier total slaughter of five hundred; inconsistency retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0832:b001:l029": "Turning back a lasso pole is the resistance image.",
    "manas-2010:p0832:b001:l038": "Detached clothing description, likely of the people subdued; not assigned to a newly invented person.",
    "manas-2010:p0833:b001:l022": "Narrative explicitly reports gossip and coercive marriage without rite; no moral endorsement implied.",
    "manas-2010:p0833:b001:l027": "Ике кыйбай = without performing the marriage rite, equivalent of нике кыйбай.",
    "manas-2010:p0833:b001:l032": "Here the horse is called Zhanaaly’s;838:25 attributes him to Karach. Both retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0833:b001:l033": "Image clearly reads мээси жок, literally without brains. Unusual praise preserved, not silently changed to ээси жок or peerless.",
    "manas-2010:p0833:b001:l037": "Үкү аяк: owl-footed horse image retained; exact equestrian connotation uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0834:b001:l021": "Буйгат figuratively deceit/trick: Yudakhin quotes this very words/eyes formula. https://el-sozduk.kg/буй/",
    "manas-2010:p0834:b001:l024": "Chewing the lead rope retains the image of breaking submission.",
    "manas-2010:p0834:b001:l028": "Throwing a leg over the tethering rail is literal; precise gesture uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0834:b001:l033": "Суук укурук is a menacing seizure image, not a temperature report.",
    "manas-2010:p0834:b001:l035": "Printed көргөзбөй сурап is ask without showing; retained despite the covert taking implied nearby.",
    "manas-2010:p0835:b001:l014": "Буудандар, literally thoroughbreds, is visibly printed as those who ride. Possible figurative epithet for heroes or textual defect; no silent replacement.",
    "manas-2010:p0835:b001:l018": "Зээр defined in this edition1838:b001:l009 as raised neck/back portion; rendered withers.",
    "manas-2010:p0835:b001:l026": "If you give precedes a threat if you do not give; both printed conditions retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0835:b001:l031": "God-struck is the narrator’s exclamation at Boz Uul’s audacity.",
    "manas-2010:p0836:b001:l025": "Бек таштап provisionally deliberate, weighty delivery; no physical stone supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0836:b001:l032": "Асый is equine tooth-age reckoning beginning at five. Sixty is the hyperbolic printed count; not converted to a precise human-year age.",
    "manas-2010:p0836:b001:l041": "Narbuudan is the horse epithet/name form here, retained alongside Narkyzyl.",
    "manas-2010:p0837:b001:l003": "The exception about a hand’s breadth of lead rope is retained literally; exact practical circumstance uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0837:b001:l020": "Бараң read as the Baran people in parallel with Chinese foes, not a gun here.",
    "manas-2010:p0837:b001:l038": "Буй кыл- = throw into confusion; Yudakhin quotes the exact white-deer/cattle parallel. https://el-sozduk.kg/буй/",
    "manas-2010:p0837:b001:l040": "Мент кыл- = maim/kill, confirmed by Yudakhin and2015 epic examples. https://el-sozduk.kg/мент/",
    "manas-2010:p0838:b001:l022": "Dark-eyed people are human captives in the plunder context; sex is not added to this line.",
    "manas-2010:p0839:b001:l003": "Blue tick simile retained with swelling/fullness; not changed to a hawk or another flattering animal.",
    "manas-2010:p0839:b001:l014": "Detached place-name list retained; Кеңдеме treated as a place-name provisionally.",
    "manas-2010:p0839:b001:l021": "Коштоп indicates accompanying/matching dress; exact paired garment unspecified.",
    "manas-2010:p0840:b001:l015": "Даңгыт = large dog, edition1836:b001:l028; not Tangut people in the body-disposal context.",
    "manas-2010:p0840:b001:l031": "Father’s-grave curse rendered literally; Burut retained as the opponents’ name for Kyrgyz.",
    "manas-2010:p0841:b001:l005": "Ак үйлүү applied to slaughtered Alöökö, previously a ruling tribute-taker. Lord of the white dwelling is provisional; dictionary also records political hostage. Exact institution unresolved. https://el-sozduk.kg/АК%20ҮЙЛҮҮ/",
    "manas-2010:p0841:b001:l020": "Без is gland; the abrupt comparison to something pierced is preserved.",
    "manas-2010:p0841:b001:l027": "Башаа = sovereign/падыша, primary Yudakhin and2015. Sentence denies divinity while granting supernatural power. https://el-sozduk.kg/БАША/",
    "manas-2010:p0841:b001:l040": "Менде read as пенде, mortal, in the recurrent negative power formula;842:3 instead has locative with me.",
    "manas-2010:p0842:b001:l011": "How many is visibly printed; ambiguous relation to the throne retained without inventing a reign duration.",
    "manas-2010:p0842:b001:l013": "One long printed display line; ellipsis supplies fight with the Khizir-touched man from context, not an extra verse.",
    "manas-2010:p0842:b001:l023": "Bread is visibly printed нан; proverbial destruction image retained rather than silently changing it to a different noun.",
    "manas-2010:p0842:b001:l038": "Кечил = monks; whether this also names an ethnopolitical group is uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0842:b001:l039": "Керүү terrain/barrier phrase provisionally a wall across the way; not a named fortress.",
    "manas-2010:p0842:b001:l042": "Burn for six years retains the image of nursing his grief/vengeance.",
    "manas-2010:p0844:b001:l013": "Owner in this childlessness context rendered heir.",
    "manas-2010:p0844:b001:l034": "Primary Manas encyclopedia defines ат кара тил болгондо as summer arriving and horses filling on green grass. https://api.libraryiksu.kg/elibrary/books/Manas%20enciklopedia%20T7189.pdf",
    "manas-2010:p0844:b001:l035": "Жонок read as a ridge/rounded height, not asserted as a verified place-name.",
    "manas-2010:p0845:b001:l008": "Кызыталак is a curse interjection in the longing for a child; no claim that the found child is illegitimate.",
    "manas-2010:p0845:b001:l013": "Медийен retained as epic desert designation, with no modern geographic identification. Earlier unpeopled rendering lacked primary lexical support and is withdrawn; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0845:b001:l021": "Oysul Ata, patron of camels, and the pale she-camel are juxtaposed; exact supernatural agency is compressed in the source.",
    "manas-2010:p0845:b001:l025": "Possessive relation to Oysul Ata is interpretive; next line explicitly identifies the camel as Akbaltay’s own bred animal.",
    "manas-2010:p0845:b001:l030": "Four repeated syllables of infant crying retained as four English wahs.",
    "manas-2010:p0845:b001:l033": "Literally eating ears and nose, rendered as a piercing cry; nose retained in the unusual image.",
    "manas-2010:p0846:b001:l016": "Сүйүнчү is the traditional glad-tidings reward call.",
    "manas-2010:p0846:b001:l020": "Суюлуп literally thinning; tears soaking the beard are not substituted for the printed verb.",
    "manas-2010:p0846:b001:l030": "My only eyes addresses the companions as precious supports; plural form preserved.",
    "manas-2010:p0846:b001:l036": "Literal chewing of white wheat flour; context is a secrecy oath. No infant feeding added. Comparable wheat-bread oath described in Kyrgyz literature textbook https://new.bizdin.kg/media/books/Kyrgyz-adabiiaty-8-klass.pdf",
    "manas-2010:p0846:b001:l038": "Ак куран rendered holy Quran; physically taking it in hand is explicit.",
    "manas-2010:p0843:b003:l007": "Subject resumes Akbaltay after the intervening Kutubiy identification; inheritance is not reassigned to Kutubiy.",
    "manas-2010:p0843:b003:l011": "Сан: Yudakhin gives countless number and sometimes ten thousand. With explicit seven, rendered seventy thousand provisionally; no claim of literal census accuracy. https://tamgasoft.kg/dict/index.php?lfrom=kg&lto=ru&word=сан"
  },
